{"suttaId":"tha-ap318","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9316,9340],"vripara":"26"},"segments":{"tha-ap318:0.3":"Āsanasanthavikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap318:1.1":"“Cetiyaṃ uttamaṃ nāma,","tha-ap318:1.2":"sikhino lokabandhuno;","tha-ap318:1.3":"Araññe irīṇe vane,","tha-ap318:1.4":"andhāhiṇḍāmahaṃ tadā. 27.","tha-ap318:2.1":"“Pavanā nikkhamantena,","tha-ap318:2.2":"diṭṭhaṃ sīhāsanaṃ mayā;","tha-ap318:2.3":"Ekaṃsaṃ añjaliṃ katvā,","tha-ap318:2.4":"santhaviṃ [thavissaṃ (sī.)] lokanāyakaṃ. 28.","tha-ap318:3.1":"“Divasabhāgaṃ thavitvāna,","tha-ap318:3.2":"buddhaṃ lokagganāyakaṃ;","tha-ap318:3.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena,","tha-ap318:3.4":"imaṃ vācaṃ udīrayiṃ. 29.","tha-ap318:4.1":"“‘Namo te purisājañña,","tha-ap318:4.2":"namo te purisuttama;","tha-ap318:4.3":"Sabbaññūsi mahāvīra,","tha-ap318:4.4":"lokajeṭṭha narāsabha’. 30.","tha-ap318:5.1":"“Abhitthavitvā sikhinaṃ,","tha-ap318:5.2":"nimittakaraṇenahaṃ;","tha-ap318:5.3":"Āsanaṃ abhivādetvā,","tha-ap318:5.4":"pakkāmiṃ uttarāmukho. 31.","tha-ap318:6.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe,","tha-ap318:6.2":"yaṃ thaviṃ vadataṃ varaṃ;","tha-ap318:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap318:6.4":"thomanāya idaṃ phalaṃ. 32.","tha-ap318:7.1":"“Sattavīse ito kappe,","tha-ap318:7.2":"atulā satta āsu te;","tha-ap318:7.3":"Sattaratanasampannā,","tha-ap318:7.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalā. 33.","tha-ap318:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","tha-ap318:8.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap318:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā āsanasanthaviko [āsanasanthavako (?), āsanathaviko (ka.), āsanatthaviko (sī. syā.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap318:10.1":"Āsanasanthavikattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ. 7."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3272,"to":3272,"paras":[{"para":3272,"vripara":"26-27","refs":["tha-ap318:1"],"lines":["Chaṭṭhāpadāne <b>cetiyaṃ uttamaṃ nāma, sikhino lokabandhuno</b>ti sakalalokattayassa bandhuno ñātakassa sikhissa bhagavato uttamaṃ cetiyaṃ.","<b>Irīṇe</b> janasañcaravirahite <b>vane</b> manussānaṃ kolāhalavirahite mahāaraññe ahosīti sambandho.","<b>Andhāhiṇḍāmahaṃ tadā</b>ti tasmiṃ kāle vane maggamūḷhabhāvena andho, na cakkhunā andho, ahaṃ āhiṇḍāmi maggaṃ pariyesāmīti attho.","<b>Pavanā nikkhamantenā</b>ti mahāvanato nikkhamantena mayā <b>sīhāsanaṃ</b> uttamāsanaṃ, sīhassa vā bhagavato āsanaṃ diṭṭhanti attho.","<b>Ekaṃsaṃ añjaliṃ katvā</b>ti ekaṃsaṃ uttarāsaṅgaṃ katvā sirasi añjaliṃ ṭhapetvāti attho.","<b>Santhaviṃ lokanāyaka</b>nti sakalalokattayanayaṃ taṃ nibbānaṃ pāpentaṃ thomitaṃ thutiṃ akāsinti attho. 34."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap318:1"],["tha-ap318:1"],["tha-ap318:1"],["tha-ap318:1"],["tha-ap318:1"],["tha-ap318:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap318:1.1","cetiyaṃ uttamaṃ nāma sikhino lokabandhuno",0,0],["tha-ap318:1.3","irīṇe",0,1],["tha-ap318:1.3","vane",0,1],["tha-ap318:1.3","andhāhiṇḍāmahaṃ tadā",0,2]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
